### Generate an inventory MCP server
POST http://127.0.0.1:9000/mcp-servers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "api_url": "http://127.0.0.1:8101",
  "name": "inventory-mcp",
  "title": "Warehouse Inventory MCP",
  "description": "Search products and manage warehouse stock",
  "version": "1.0.0"
}

